  "title": "Deep soil per small tree: 9 m2, width 2 m (or 1 m with a 1 m rootable soil zone) (Table 3.3b)",
  "text": "Landscaping includes existing and new trees with shade producing canopies in accordance with Tables 3.3a and 3.3b. Table 3.3b Small: required DSA per tree 9m2; recommended minimum DSA width 2m; minimum DSA width where additional rootable soil zone (RSZ) provided (min 1m depth) 1m (DSA) + 1m (RSZ). (1) Rootable areas are for the purposes of determining minimum width only and do not have the effect of reducing the required DSA.",
